OL,3,ABillionaire Man United owner loses
OL,4,Amoral high ground after tax exile,
OL,5,ALabour chair says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Labour Party chair has said Sir Jim
OL,8,FRatcliffe loses "the moral high ground"
OL,9,Fby making statements about the UK while
OL,10,Fliving in tax exile.
OL,12,FSpeaking to Sunday with Laura
OL,13,FKuenssberg, Bridget Phillipson said she
OL,14,Fwould take the billionaire
OL,15,Fbusinessman's comments that the UK was
OL,16,F"on the slide" with a "pinch of salt".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
