OL,3,ABillionaire Man United owner loses
OL,4,Amoral high ground after tax exile,
OL,5,ALabour chair says
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Jim, the founder of petrochemical
OL,8,Fgiant Ineos and Manchester United's
OL,9,Fco-owner, told the BBC he has lost
OL,10,Fconfidence in the UK due to a
OL,11,Fcombination of high taxes and high
OL,12,Fimmigration.
OL,14,FHe has been a tax resident in Monaco
OL,15,Fsince 2020 and said "things would have
OL,16,Fto get better" in the UK for him to
OL,17,Freturn.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
